  m_Name: PolandQuestion24
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HowX.Data.QuestionData
  text:
    en: The rest of the world calls it a "Fashion Crime". We call it "Comfort". What
      is it?
    native: "Reszta \u015Bwiata nazywa to \"Zbrodni\u0105 Mody\". My nazywamy to
      \"Wygod\u0105\". Co to?"
  visual: {fileID: 0}
  useImageAnswers: 1
  answers:
  - text:
      en: Image of Crocs with accessories
      native: 
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bbb892429af606a4f9293fb1052fd969, type: 3}
    isCorrect: 0
  - text:
      en: Image of Ripped Jeans
      native: 
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ed4a2fc66ac3326439d4254d647cbdb4, type: 3}
    isCorrect: 0
  - text:
      en: Image of Socks with Sandals
      native: 
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7f398e4defee2a448bc745d38be2bb1d, type: 3}
    isCorrect: 1
  - text:
      en: Image of Saszetka
      native: 
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 369df542bb021a5408d55f3e5b38a325, type: 3}
    isCorrect: 0
  explanation:
    en: Why let sand touch your feet? Why let the wind bite your toes? Socks and
      Sandals is the peak of evolution.
    native: "Dlaczego piasek ma dotyka\u0107 st\xF3p? Dlaczego wiatr ma gry\u017A\u0107
      palce? Skarpety i Sanda\u0142y to szczyt ewolucji."
